{"id":"word:hebrew:H7782","type":"word","title":"שׁוֹפָר","subtitle":"H7782 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a cornet (as giving a clear sound) or curved horn","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שׁוֹפָר (H7782) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 72 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שׁוֹפָר (shôwphâr) means a cornet (as giving a clear sound) or curved horn First listed occurrence: 1Chr 15 28."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שׁוֹפָר","transliteration":"shôwphâr","pronunciation":"sho-far'","strong":"H7782","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7782","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["בַּ/שּׁוֹפָ֔ר","שׁוֹפָ֖ר","שׁוֹפָֽר","הַ/שּׁוֹפָ֔ר","שׁוֹפָ֑ר"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",25],["HRd/Ncmsa",16],["HRd/Ncmpa",10],["HTd/Ncmsa",9],["HNcmpc",4],["HTd/Ncmpa",3],["HC/R/Ncmpa",1],["HR/Ncmsa",1],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",1],["HNcmpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a cornet (as giving a clear sound) or curved horn","usage":"cornet, trumpet.","full":"H7782. shophar שׁוֺפָר שֹׁפָר, 72 noun masculine Isa 27:13 horn, for blowing (Aramaic שׁיפורא √ dubious; CAdler PAOS 1889, Clxxi ff. compare Assyrian šappar(u) a species of wild goat; in any case the ׳שׁ is a curved horn, as of cow or ram, compare Dr Amos 2:2 (with illustrations)); — absolute ׳שׁוֺ 2Sam 6:15 +, ׳שׁ Exod 19:16 +; construct שׁוֺפַר Lev 25:9 ; plural שׁוֺפָרוֺת Judg 7:22 +, construct שׁוֺפְרוֺת Josh 6:4 +; suffix שׁוֺפְרֹתֵיהֶם Judg 7:8 ; &#8212; horn , mostly as used in war, rarely, and chiefly late, as sacred instrument: Hosea 8:1 ; Judg 7:8 , 16 ; Isa 58:1 (simile) Job 39:25 ( שׁ ׳בְּדֵי , see דַּי 2a ); ׳שׁ (הַ)יּוֺבְלִים Josh 6:4 rams' horns (see יבל ), so 6:6 ; 6:8 ; 6:13 (all E); (הַ)שׁ ׳קוֺל Exod 19:16 , 19 ; 20:18 (Gi 20:15 ), Josh 6:5 , 20 (all E), Amos 2:2 13 t.; בַּשּׁ ׳תָּקַע = give a blast with the horn , Judg 3:27 ; 6:34 ; Josh 6:4 9 t. Joshua, 1Sam 13:3 ; 1Kin 1:34 , 39 9 t., +( ׳י subject) Zech 9:14 ; שׁ ׳תָּקַע Hosea 5:8 ; Amos 3:6 (verb Niph`al), Jer 4:5 7 t., + הַשּׁ ׳תֹּקְעֵי Josh 6:9 Qr (Kt תָּֽקְעוּ ); compare ׳הַשּׁ לִתְקוֺעַ Judg 7:20 , שׁ ׳בְּתֵקַע Psa 150:3 ; also שׁ ׳הֶעֱבִיר תְּרוּעָה Lev 25:9 a (H), compare 25:9 b (P), שׁ ׳יוֺם וּתְרוּעָה Zeph 1:16 ; used on religious occasions, Josh 6:4 ff.; Lev 25:9 ; Joel 2:1 ; 2:15 ; Psa 47:6 ; 81:4 ; 98:6 ; 150:3 ; 2Chr 15:14 . — On ׳שׁ see Adler The Shophar (1894) Dr Amos 2:2 Hpt We Psalms Transl. 221 f. Abrahams Hast. DB TRUMPET .","rootNote":"or שֹׁפָר ; from 8231 in the original sense of incising ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 15 28","keyReferences":["1Chr 15 28","1Kgs 1 34","1Kgs 1 39","1Kgs 1 41","1Sam 13 3","2Chr 15 14","2Kgs 9 13","2Sam 2 28"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":72,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 15 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":15,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שׁוֹפָ֔ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 34","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שּׁוֹפָ֔ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 39","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שּׁוֹפָ֔ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 41","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שּׁוֹפָ֔ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 13 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":13,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שּׁוֹפָ֤ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 15 14","book":"2Chr","chapter":15,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בְ/שׁוֹפָרֽוֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 13","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שּׁוֹפָ֔ר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 2 28","book":"2Sam","chapter":2,"verse":28,"englishText":"","s